<title>INDIA: India Bajaj Auto 96/97 net seen rising.</title>
<headline>India Bajaj Auto 96/97 net seen rising.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net profit of scooter giant Bajaj Auto is expected to improve 15.6 percent to 4.83 billion rupees in the year ended March 31, 1997, a Reuter poll of 28 leading securities and brokerage firms showed.</p>
<p>Projections ranged from 4.31 billion rupees to 5.31 billion</p>
<p>rupees against 4.18 billion a year ago.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>BAJAJ AUTO    ----PAT seen up 15.6%, sales up 8.81%</p>
<p>			Net profit  1995/96     Net sales  1995/96</p>
<p>				  (in million rupees)</p>
<p>Average		4,833.31   4,181.20   30,401.51   27,939.00</p>
<p>High		   5,311.00		  35,850.00</p>
<p>Low		    4,310.00		  25,058.00</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
